cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this corpus, its pipeline or its schemas, please cite it."
title: "Operational Context Corpus for Autonomous Systems"
abstract: >-
  A reproducible corpus linking real telemetry from autonomous systems to the
  external operating conditions under which it was produced, with a queryable
  schema and full provenance. Its first result is an agreement analysis between
  ERA5 reanalysis wind and onboard PX4 EKF2 wind estimates over 871 flights,
  pre-specified before the result existed: no evidence of a systematic
  component-wise offset, and agreement too imprecise for the reanalysis to
  substitute for the onboard estimate. An operational-design-domain
  representation is in scope and not yet built.
type: software
repository-code: "https://github.com/AndreaBozzo/occas"
authors:
  - family-names: Bozzo
    given-names: Andrea
license: Apache-2.0
version: 0.0.0
date-released: 2026-08-20
